-		<English>Increases city's science output and generates some culture as well. Required before you can build Plato's Academy.</English>
-		<French>Increases city's science output and generates some culture as well. Required before you can build Plato's Academy.</French>
-		<German>Increases city's science output and generates some culture as well. Required before you can build Plato's Academy.</German>
-		<Italian>Increases city's science output and generates some culture as well. Required before you can build Plato's Academy.</Italian>
-		<Spanish>Increases city's science output and generates some culture as well. Required before you can build Plato's Academy.</Spanish>
+		<English>Increases research output by 15%, provides one scientist slot and produces culture. Most useful in cities with substantial research output. A Library replaces this building, so their research bonuses do not add together.</English>
+		<French>Augmente la recherche de 15 %, offre un emplacement de scientifique et produit de la culture. Particulièrement utile dans les villes dotées d'une recherche importante. Une bibliothèque remplace ce bâtiment : leurs bonus de recherche ne se cumulent pas.</French>
+		<German>Erhöht die Forschung um 15 %, bietet einen Wissenschaftlerplatz und erzeugt Kultur. Besonders nützlich in Städten mit hoher Forschungsleistung. Eine Bibliothek ersetzt dieses Gebäude; ihre Forschungsboni werden nicht addiert.</German>
+		<Italian>Aumenta la ricerca del 15%, offre uno spazio per uno scienziato e produce cultura. È particolarmente utile nelle città con una ricerca elevata. Una Biblioteca sostituisce questo edificio: i loro bonus alla ricerca non si sommano.</Italian>
+		<Spanish>Aumenta la investigación un 15%, ofrece un puesto de científico y produce cultura. Resulta especialmente útil en ciudades con una investigación elevada. Una Biblioteca sustituye este edificio, por lo que sus bonificaciones a la investigación no se suman.</Spanish>
