 	<TEXT>
 		<Tag>TXT_KEY_TECH_TRADE_STRATEGY</Tag>
-		<English>This tech addes +1 trade route per city and allows Bazzar, Buchery and Silk Road as well as Trade Caravan units. It also enables barter system civic, which reduces the cost of cities and provides a commerces bonus. This technology leads the way for future commercial technologies.</English>
-		<French>This tech addes +1 trade route per city and allows Bazzar, Buchery and Silk Road as well as Trade Caravan units. It also enables barter system civic, which reduces the cost of cities and provides a commerces bonus. This technology leads the way for future commercial technologies.</French>
-		<German>This tech addes +1 trade route per city and allows Bazzar, Buchery and Silk Road as well as Trade Caravan units. It also enables barter system civic, which reduces the cost of cities and provides a commerces bonus. This technology leads the way for future commercial technologies.</German>
-		<Italian>This tech addes +1 trade route per city and allows Bazzar, Buchery and Silk Road as well as Trade Caravan units. It also enables barter system civic, which reduces the cost of cities and provides a commerces bonus. This technology leads the way for future commercial technologies.</Italian>
-		<Spanish>This tech addes +1 trade route per city and allows Bazzar, Buchery and Silk Road as well as Trade Caravan units. It also enables barter system civic, which reduces the cost of cities and provides a commerces bonus. This technology leads the way for future commercial technologies.</Spanish>
+		<English>Adds one trade route per city and enables Open Borders agreements. Connect cities to profitable trading partners to benefit from the extra capacity. Trade also opens paths toward Writing and Metal Casting.</English>
+		<French>Ajoute une route commerciale par ville et permet les accords de libre passage. Reliez vos villes à des partenaires commerciaux rentables pour profiter de cette capacité supplémentaire. Le commerce ouvre aussi la voie à l'écriture et au moulage du métal.</French>
+		<German>Ermöglicht einen zusätzlichen Handelsweg pro Stadt und Abkommen über offene Grenzen. Verbindet Städte mit ertragreichen Handelspartnern, um die zusätzliche Kapazität zu nutzen. Handel eröffnet außerdem Wege zur Schrift und zum Metallguss.</German>
+		<Italian>Aggiunge una rotta commerciale per città e permette gli accordi di Apertura delle frontiere. Collega le città a partner commerciali redditizi per sfruttare questa capacità aggiuntiva. Il commercio apre inoltre la strada alla Scrittura e alla Fusione del metallo.</Italian>
+		<Spanish>Añade una ruta comercial por ciudad y permite acuerdos de Apertura de fronteras. Conecta las ciudades con socios comerciales rentables para aprovechar esa capacidad adicional. El comercio también abre caminos hacia la Escritura y la Fundición del metal.</Spanish>
