-		<German>Gives 20% bonus for trade routes. Can be built in cities which have access to river. Building Harbor in the same city disables this building.</German>
-		<Italian>Gives 20% bonus for trade routes. Can be built in cities which have access to river. Building Harbor in the same city disables this building.</Italian>
